#: ../../source/overview.rst:2
msgid "What Daedalus Studio Does"
msgstr "Daedalus Studio 能做什么"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:4
msgid ""
"Studio is designed for development work that should leave a clear, "
"reviewable result in your project. You can ask a question, inspect a "
"project, make a bounded edit, or let the agent coordinate a larger "
"workflow. Studio shows the important evidence in the session timeline "
"instead of hiding all activity behind a chat reply."
msgstr ""
"Studio 面向需要在项目中留下清晰、可审查结果的开发工作。你可以提问、检查项目、执行范围明确的编辑，或让 agent "
"协调更大的工作流。Studio 会在会话时间线中展示重要证据，而不是把所有活动隐藏在一条聊天回复后面。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:10
msgid "The three parts of a normal installation are:"
msgstr "一次普通安装包含三个部分："

#: ../../source/overview.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Studio** is the desktop application. It owns the windows, workspaces, "
"sessions, settings, updates, and the managed local backend lifecycle."
msgstr "**Studio** 是桌面应用程序，负责窗口、工作区、会话、设置、更新，以及本地托管后端的生命周期。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Backend** runs provider connections, agent runs, tools, approvals, "
"session persistence, and project services."
msgstr "**Backend** 负责供应商连接、agent 运行、工具、审批、会话持久化和项目服务。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Godot Daedalus** is the editor plugin. It connects a running Godot "
"editor to editor-aware tools and diagnostics when a project needs live "
"editor access."
msgstr "**Godot Daedalus** 是编辑器插件。当项目需要实时访问编辑器时，它会把正在运行的 Godot 编辑器连接到编辑器工具和诊断功能。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:20
msgid ""
"The backend is local to your computer by default. Model requests still go"
" to the provider you configure, and any external MCP server or web-search"
" service you enable is an additional trust boundary."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，后端运行在你的电脑本地。模型请求仍会发送给你配置的供应商，而你启用的任何外部 MCP server "
"或网页搜索服务都会形成额外的信任边界。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:25
msgid "What you can do"
msgstr "你可以做什么"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:27
msgid ""
"Studio combines several activities that are usually spread across "
"separate windows:"
msgstr "Studio 将通常分散在多个窗口中的活动集中在一起："

#: ../../source/overview.rst:30
msgid "Keep multiple project workspaces and persistent sessions."
msgstr "维护多个项目工作区和持久会话。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:31
msgid "Attach files, folders, images, or other project context to a request."
msgstr "为请求附加文件、文件夹、图像或其他项目上下文。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:32
msgid "Inspect and edit Godot scenes, resources, scripts, and project settings."
msgstr "检查和编辑 Godot 场景、资源、脚本及项目设置。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:33
msgid "Review file patches and Git diffs before accepting a result."
msgstr "在接受结果前审查文件补丁和 Git diff。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:34
msgid "Run terminal checks and read diagnostics from Godot tooling."
msgstr "运行终端检查，并读取 Godot 工具提供的诊断信息。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:35
msgid ""
"Inspect a selected Windows desktop window or control supported UI "
"elements after granting per-turn access."
msgstr "授予每轮访问权限后，检查选定的 Windows 桌面窗口或控制受支持的 UI 元素。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:37
msgid ""
"Research with the embedded Browser, or use an approved external "
"Chrome/Edge browser workflow when the task explicitly names its URL."
msgstr "使用内置 Browser 进行研究，或在任务明确写出 URL 时，使用经过批准的外部 Chrome/Edge 浏览器工作流。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:39
msgid ""
"Pause for approval, resume after an interruption, and retry from recorded"
" evidence rather than blindly replaying completed writes."
msgstr "在等待审批时暂停，在中断后恢复，并依据已记录的证据重试，而不是盲目重放已经完成的写入。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:41
msgid ""
"Add providers, custom models, MCP servers, and Skills while keeping them "
"inside Studio's tool and approval policies."
msgstr "添加供应商、自定义模型、MCP server 和 Skill，同时让它们受 Studio 的工具与审批策略约束。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:45
msgid "How to think about Studio"
msgstr "如何理解 Studio"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:47
msgid "There are four useful layers:"
msgstr "可以把 Studio 理解为四个层次："

#: ../../source/overview.rst:49
msgid "``Workspace``"
msgstr "工作区 ``Workspace``"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:50
msgid ""
"A project or directory boundary. File, Git, Godot, and terminal "
"operations are checked against this boundary."
msgstr "项目或目录边界。文件、Git、Godot 和终端操作都会针对这个边界进行检查。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:53
msgid "``Session``"
msgstr "会话 ``Session``"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:54
msgid ""
"A durable conversation and its project context. A session remembers its "
"messages, attachments, run history, approvals, and layout state."
msgstr "持久化的对话及其项目上下文。会话会记住消息、附件、运行历史、审批和布局状态。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:57
msgid "``Run``"
msgstr "运行 ``Run``"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:58
msgid ""
"One execution of a request. A run may be a direct answer, an inspection, "
"a small edit, or a multi-stage workflow."
msgstr "一次请求的执行。一次运行可以是直接回答、检查、少量编辑或多阶段工作流。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:61
msgid "``Evidence``"
msgstr "证据 ``Evidence``"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:62
msgid ""
"The inputs and results that let you judge the run: tool calls, patches, "
"terminal output, diagnostics, warnings, and verification status."
msgstr "帮助你判断运行结果的输入和产物：工具调用、补丁、终端输出、诊断、警告和验证状态。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:65
msgid ""
"The most reliable habit is to state the desired outcome, give the agent "
"the smallest useful context, and inspect the evidence before you accept a"
" change."
msgstr "最可靠的使用习惯是说明期望结果，向 agent 提供最小但有用的上下文，并在接受变更前检查证据。"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:69
msgid "Find the right feature"
msgstr "找到合适的功能"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:71
msgid "If you want to..."
msgstr "如果你想要……"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:73
msgid "set up Studio for the first time, start with :doc:`getting-started/index`;"
msgstr "首次设置 Studio，请从 :doc:`getting-started/index` 开始；"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:74
msgid ""
"understand the main window and its panels, read "
":doc:`workspaces/workbench`;"
msgstr "了解主窗口及其面板，请阅读 :doc:`workspaces/workbench`；"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:76
msgid "write or review a request, read :doc:`agent/composer`;"
msgstr "编写或审查请求，请阅读 :doc:`agent/composer`；"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:77
msgid "understand what happened during a run, read :doc:`agent/timeline`;"
msgstr "了解一次运行中发生了什么，请阅读 :doc:`agent/timeline`；"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:78
msgid ""
"inspect model, tool, browser, or desktop execution records, read "
":doc:`agent/trajectory`;"
msgstr "检查模型、工具、浏览器或桌面执行记录，请阅读 :doc:`agent/trajectory`；"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:80
msgid "make a longer task track its own progress, read :doc:`agent/goals`;"
msgstr "让较长任务跟踪自身进度，请阅读 :doc:`agent/goals`；"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:81
msgid ""
"inspect or control a Windows desktop window, read :doc:`tools/computer-"
"use`;"
msgstr "检查或控制 Windows 桌面窗口，请阅读 :doc:`tools/computer-use`；"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:82
msgid ""
"control a Chrome or Edge tab outside Studio, read :doc:`tools/external-"
"browser`;"
msgstr "控制 Studio 外部的 Chrome 或 Edge 标签页，请阅读 :doc:`tools/external-browser`；"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:84
msgid "inspect files, Git, commands, or web pages, read :doc:`tools/index`;"
msgstr "检查文件、Git、命令或网页，请阅读 :doc:`tools/index`；"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:85
msgid "connect Godot, read :doc:`godot/index`;"
msgstr "连接 Godot，请阅读 :doc:`godot/index`；"

#: ../../source/overview.rst:86
msgid "configure providers and integrations, read :doc:`settings/index`."
msgstr "配置供应商和集成，请阅读 :doc:`settings/index`。"
